ent  that a recurrence of incident 1529-1  occurs alpine echo deploys to the  mountain by helicopter and so by the  grace of the foundation  you will be saved although sitting  helplessly in the snow you may feel your  current state of existence can be best  described by the phrase dead meat you  are more than likely to be saved than  slaughtered even still there is no  comfort in the future on the mountain  right here right now you are looking up  and locking eyes with scp-1529  your whole life has come to this moment  all you ever wanted as a child was to  climb the highest heights aspiring  upward has brought you so many good  things adventures financial stability  respect everything you have in your life  is from the simple fact that you did not  settle for what you had but strived for  what was above you but now this same  impulse has gotten you in a world of  trouble had you just looked at where you  were instead of where you wanted to be  you would have been okay if you had just  felt the snow beneath your feet you  would have been okay but instead you  looked up how you always did you looked  up toward the goal and away from the  present and look where it has led you  the message of this story is clear but  if for some reason we resist the lesson  passed down from one generation of  thinkers to the next  scp-1529 is out there waiting for us to  turn over our shoulder and look back or  tilt our chin and look up and at that  point it will force the moral on you  again giving you no other option but to  experience its wrath  right here  right now  now go check out frozen bodies on  everest r live  scp-5140 and scp-096 killed my friend  for more high-altitude horrors
 

